# ===== 小程序自动化测试框架 · Git 忽略规则 =====
# 作用：告诉 git 哪些文件不需要纳入版本管理。
# 说明：本文件只影响 git，不影响程序运行；删除它也不会导致任何功能异常。

# ---------- Python ----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# 虚拟环境
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ---------- Node.js ----------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# ---------- 测试产物 ----------
# 截图与报告属于「每次执行都会变」的产物，不应进版本库
report/
.pytest_cache/
test-results/
playwright-report/

# ---------- 日志 ----------
logs/
*.log
log/

# ---------- 运行期临时文件 ----------
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# ---------- 配置中的敏感信息 ----------
# config/config.yaml 常含账号密码、数据库连接串，默认不入库
# 如需纳入版本管理，删除下面两行即可
config/config.yaml
config/local.yaml
.env
.env.*

# ---------- 编辑器 / IDE ----------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# ---------- 操作系统 ----------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------- SSH keys (safety net) ----------
# A leaked private key equals a leaked identity. Keys normally live in
# ~/.ssh and never inside the project, but keep these patterns as a guard
# in case one is ever copied into the working directory by accident.
id_rsa
id_rsa.pub
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.pub
id_ed25519_*
id_ecdsa
id_ecdsa.pub
*.pem
*.key
*.ppk
*_public_key.txt
ssh_config*.txt
